{
  "iri": "http://www.ebi.ac.uk/efo/EFO_0003106",
  "lang": "en",
  "description": [
    "A lung disease that involves lung parenchyma or alveolar inflammation and abnormal alveolar filling with fluid (consolidation and exudation). It results from infection with bacteria, viruses, fungi or parasites. It is accompanied by fever, chills, cough, and difficulty in breathing."
  ],
  "synonyms": [
